Cozy Cat Bakery

About

Cozy Cat Bakery is a cute bakery game created using Microsoft MakeCode Arcade. The player controls a baker cat who prepares desserts for customer cats. Customers randomly order one or two different desserts, and the player must bake and serve them to earn points.

How to Play

Listen to the customer's order.

Press A to bake the requested dessert.

Press A again to serve it.

Complete the order to welcome the next customer.

Earn points for every dessert served!

Features

Three desserts: cupcakes, apple pies and cookies.

Random orders with one or two different desserts.

Customer dialogue and reactions.

Baking sounds and heart effects.

Score tracking.

Animated customer movement.

Programming Concepts

Variables: Track the current order and game progress.

Lists: Store dessert images, names and customer orders.

Conditionals: Control the baking and serving stages.

Loops: Shuffle desserts and create customer orders.

Functions: Organise the game into separate tasks.

Randomisation: Generate different orders and dialogue.

Events: Detect when the player presses A.

Tools Used

Microsoft MakeCode Arcade

Python-style programming

Custom pixel-art sprites and backgrounds
